        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>device</name>
        <qualifiedname>AVD3D12VADeviceContext::device</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Device used for objects creation and access. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This can also be used to set the libavcodec decoding device.</para>
<para>Can be set by the user. This is the only mandatory field - the other device context fields are set from this and are available for convenience.</para>
<para>Deallocating the <ref refid="structAVHWDeviceContext" kindref="compound">AVHWDeviceContext</ref> will always release this interface, and it does not matter whether it was user-allocated. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
